  "hh_ethnologue_comment": {
    "comment": "E16/E17/E18/E19/E20/E21/E22/E23/E24/E25/E26/E27/E28/E29 lists two separate neighbouring languages Bozaba\n[bzo] and Bomboli [bml] of the Ngiri area of the DRC. The corresponding ethnic groups speak intelligible languages, exhibiting only minor differences (**hh:hvld:FultzMorgan:Ubangi-Mongala**:5, 8, 21-22).\nEven if the two groups see each other as different, only one language entry is justified. See also: Bomboli-Bozaba [bml].",
